# TrekFont
#
# '(' and '[' are one bitmap, and so are ')' and ']'.
#
# From https://mdfs.net/Apps/Font/ (TrekFont), a collection of BBC fonts
# dated 1989 to 1991, held there as VDU 23 character definitions.
#
# Characters 32 to 126 (95 glyphs).
#
# Characters sharing one bitmap, which nothing can tell
# apart from the pixels alone:
#     '(', '['
#     ')', ']'

